Excluded: schema/upstream/ holds third-party schemas under their own authors' licences; nothing
in this file changes those terms.

The schemas are the wire layer — the contracts commitwork's files, reports and inputs are
validated against — and carry a different licence from the rest of the repository so that a reader
who validates against them or generates them owes no copyleft obligation. Which files are the wire
layer is declared in ../manifests/wire-layer.json; everything not listed there is AGPL-3.0-or-later
(../LICENSING.md).
